cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use MONET, please cite the software and the article that introduced its
  decorrelation workflow, and the libraries behind the analyses you used
  (ASE, MDAnalysis; see "Citing and licences" in README.md).
type: software
title: "MONET: Molecular Dynamics Extractor"
abstract: >-
  Extracts configurations from molecular-dynamics trajectories, writes
  quantum-chemistry inputs for each sampled configuration and analyses the
  trajectory with ASE, MDAnalysis and its own methods (autocorrelation and
  decorrelation stride, pairwise RMSD, RDF, MSD, VDOS, fluctuations and trends).
